# MilkFlint (ui feature "vpn"): the DNS lookups redirected from port 53 to the
# VPN client's DNS forwarder (port 5455, table inet milkflint_vpn_dns) are let
# in from every inside zone, as the lookups to port 53 they were. Only that
# redirect turns port 53 into 5455; nothing else is opened.
meta l4proto { tcp, udp } th dport 5455 ct status dnat ct original proto-dst 53 counter accept comment "MilkFlint: DNS redirected to VPN DNS"
